          "documentId": "doc-5f8f89c22c41",
          "text": "Gaetz is the retired co-founder of VITAS Healthcare Corp., a hospice care provider that comforts patients and their families and preserves their dignity in the face of terminal illness. ",
          "start": 277,
          "end": 463,
          "context": "Evidence 1: Did Matt Gaetz's father Don Gaetz co-found Vitas?  Gaetz is the retired co-founder of VITAS Healthcare Corp., a hospice care provider that comforts patients and their families and preserves their dignity in the face of terminal illness.  He was also president of the National Hospice Organization.\n\n"
        },
        {
